2026-09-14 - VectraRAT: An Undocumented Full-Stack MaaS Built From Scratch

Research URL: https://socradar.io/blog/vectrarat-undocumented-stack-maas/

Key Points
- STRU has identified a completely undocumented RAT that has been operating for years under the name Nyxel, also undocumented, which is for sale on the black market starting at $250
- OpenDirs containing information about an infrastructure belonging to the attacker, along with binaries related to VectraRAT, have been found
- Dozens of uncategorized infrastructures and binaries related to the new RAT have been identified since June 2026.
- The adversary relies on an ELF file to generate autonomous platforms for its clients, which serves as a command center for the victims and to generate the RAT.
- Dozens of victims have been identified, with the United States being the primary target.

